7. Submission audit
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Submit the handwritten Part I, the completed four-line bridge, material Codex prompts, both source artifacts, validation output, the rejected-input test, and a short audit naming one generated step you checked independently. End with one paragraph separating:
\end_layout

